== #link("https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=3671208957")[WBK Simple Support]

- *Type:* Mechanics
- *Mod ID:* `3671208957`
- *Dependencies:* [#link("https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=450814997")[CBA_A3]]
- *Description:* Call-in support system for CAS, artillery, and supply drops via radio. Configurable via CBA settings.
- *System Impact:* Adds player-directed fire support coordination. Requires map marking and radio communication for effective use.
- *Verified:* 2025-06-17
]

#block(fill: rgb("f5f5f5"), stroke: (left: 4pt + rgb("e74c3c")), inset: 12pt, radius: 4pt)[
== #link("https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=3600001673")[AI Auto mount as vehicle Gunner]

- *Type:* Mechanics
- *Mod ID:* `3600001673`
- *Description:* AI automatically mounts as vehicle gunners when players enter driver or commander seats.
- *System Impact:* Changes AI behavior to fill vacant crew positions. Reduces the need to manually order AI into vehicles.
- *Verified:* 2025-06-17
]

#block(fill: rgb("f5f5f5"), stroke: (left: 4pt + rgb("e74c3c")), inset: 12pt, radius: 4pt)[
== #link("https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=3399739919")[Expanded Anti Air]

- *Type:* Mechanics
- *Mod ID:* `3399739919`
- *Description:* Enhances AI air defense logic — better engagement ranges, reaction times, and coordination between AA units.
- *System Impact:* Makes enemy AA more dangerous and realistic. Air assault missions require proper SEAD.
- *Verified:* 2025-06-17
]

